config ROTHKO_MIWILL
	tristate "Rothko MiWiLL Ethernet redundancy"
	depends on INET
	help
	  Provide a MiWiLL virtual link for a configured pair of Wi-Fi ports
	  and a MiWiLL gateway in the initial network namespace.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called miwill. If unsure, say N.
